<title>USA: Tupperware Corp Q3 net shrinks.</title>
<headline>Tupperware Corp Q3 net shrinks.</headline>
<dateline>ORLANDO, Fla. 1996-10-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>(Dollars in millions, except per share)</p>
<p>					  13 Weeks Ended</p>
<p>					Sep 28,    Sep 30,</p>
<p>					  1996	  1995</p>
<p> SALES:				 290.6	291.9</p>
<p> Net income			    18.1	 18.3</p>
<p> PRO FORMA NET INCOME		18.1	 15.7</p>
<p>Pro forma net income excluding costs</p>
<p>associated with becoming an</p>
<p>   independent company	     20.0	 15.7</p>
<p>Per common and common</p>
<p>equivalent share:</p>
<p>     Pro forma net income	  0.29	 0.25</p>
<p>Pro forma net income excluding</p>
<p>	 costs associated with</p>
<p>	 becoming an independent</p>
<p>	 company			 0.32	 0.25</p>
<p>Average number of common and common equivalent shares</p>
<p>   (millions)			  63.1	 63.1</p>
<p>					     39	Weeks Ended</p>
<p>					Sep 28,    Sep 30,</p>
<p>					  1996	 1995</p>
<p> SALES:				 998.6	973.1</p>
<p> Net income			   100.3	 96.8</p>
<p> PRO FORMA NET INCOME		96.0	 89.1</p>
<p>Pro forma net income excluding</p>
<p>costs associated with becoming</p>
<p>   an independent company	  99.5	 89.1</p>
<p>Per common and common</p>
<p>equivalent share:</p>
<p>     Pro forma net income	  1.52	 1.41</p>
<p>Pro forma net income</p>
<p>excluding costs</p>
<p>associated with</p>
<p>becoming an</p>
<p>	independent company	  1.57	 1.41</p>
<p>Average number of common and</p>
<p>common equivalent shares</p>
<p>   (millions)			  63.2	 63.1</p>
<p>NOTE - First Call mean estimate for Q3 was $0.29 per share</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
</text>
